# BuildKit reads this because it sits next to the Dockerfile. The build context
# is the repo root, so allowlist only what the image needs; nothing else (the
# kubeconfig, .env files, other services) is even sent to the builder.
*
!services/agents/
!shared/leash_shared/
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/trace-spool
